e-1e887d574628" class="r-uan3l1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Are there any side effects?</p></span></div><div data-rid="7b6f4c30-dbf7-4d81-be77-a7be85476988" class="r-152s6li"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rilr2:"><div data-rid="12b7959f-410c-4e14-903d-a9b31f0ebe95" class="r-1gj84cf"><div data-rid="5097a794-6ceb-443e-a564-2a34976fd2ee" class="r-c1kn0o alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Made from natural ingredients, our gummies are generally well-tolerated. If you experience any adverse reactions, please stop use and consult a doctor.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="5d678a94-17e9-4703-8bcd-2c8acf425d6e" class="r-dabs2j" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="15709a9f-5bf9-4b76-b845-23c01d22d25d" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rmlr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-ya5ffp"><div data-rid="352e19bc-775d-4ac0-b408-af18e5ffae55" class="r-i2ld3y alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How Many Gummies Do I Take A Day?</p></span></div><div data-rid="a69f85fc-62cb-4ce5-9e98-e180c3f90a1d" class="r-1h40ufc"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span>